**EC tells Supreme Court Centre’s citizenship scrutiny powers are limited - The Hindu** — GS2 › polity › constitution ✅
- Why: Election Commission of India dismissed arguments by opposition parties regarding the Centre's exclusive authority to scrutinise citizenship, asserting its own jurisdiction.
